WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The supplied facts are the content. The requested register controls presentation.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Fixed templates retain the same three literals across all requested formats.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A simpler-looking sentence can omit information needed to act.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Preservation, truth and reader understanding require different checks.
